    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is David. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767312974200000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 53787,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767312978800000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. I see on your account you recently purchased a pair of our Road Cycling Shoes. Is that the item you're calling about?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767312980800000
