      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 53787,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767312991466666
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. To make sure I understand correctly, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault, maybe with how the cleats are mounting, or more of a preference or fit issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767312993199999
